entries.summary:
Update an existing job's configuration. Only the fields you provide are changed — everything else stays the same.
Cannot update a currently running job (stop it first with bash or wait for it to finish).
Common use cases:
- Fix a buggy command: { jobId, command: "python3 fixed_script.py" }
- Add missing requirements: { jobId, requirements: ["requests", "beautifulsoup4"] }
- Change a dependency: { jobId, dependsOn: [{ jobId: "...", onStatus: "completed", autoTrigger: true }] } — include autoTrigger: true whenever the job should start automatically when the parent completes; omitting it remov...
